    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Hell\u00a0</strong>is a fast-paced arena action game inspired by classic hack-and-slash and survival mechanics. Plunge into a brutal arena filled with relentless enemies, where every move counts. Armed with only your blade and blood-fueled powers, you must navigate tight spaces and face waves of foes that will stop at nothing to destroy you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your abilities come at a cost, and there\u2019s no room for mistakes. Use quick reflexes, precise strikes, and calculated aggression to survive \u2014 as long as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for survival time against Steam Friends or on global leaderboards. Only those with true skill and nerves of steel will last. Your ability to balance risk and power will be tested to the limit.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Hell\u00a0</strong>is a fast-paced arena action game inspired by classic hack-and-slash and survival mechanics. Plunge into a brutal arena filled with relentless enemies, where every move counts. Armed with only your blade and blood-fueled powers, you must navigate tight spaces and face waves of foes that will stop at nothing to destroy you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your abilities come at a cost, and there\u2019s no room for mistakes. Use quick reflexes, precise strikes, and calculated aggression to survive \u2014 as long as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for survival time against Steam Friends or on global leaderboards. Only those with true skill and nerves of steel will last. Your ability to balance risk and power will be tested to the limit.</p>",
